input/sourcedata/
# original_study/ holds the PAPER's own material ONLY (PDF, figures, published data, its code) —
# fully git-ignored. Everything WE author or generate lives under report/ (tracked), including our
# replication analysis in report/analysis/ (targets.md, figures.md, backend-fit.md, adherence.md).
original_study/

# Generated report artifacts + working notes. report.qmd (the whole report) + report_internal.qmd
